  "worked_solution": "The complement of $X,$ denoted $\\overset{\u2015}{X},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $X.$\n\nThe elements of $U$ that are not in $X$ are $4,$ $8,$ $16,$ and $32.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $X$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{\u2015}{X}={4,8,16,32}.\n$$",
